le dining with their parents. Children 12 years of age and above are considered as adult guests.&lt;br&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Lunch &amp; Dinner (À La Carte Dining)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#10;&#10;Children of all ages have the option of ordering from kids or full menu during à la carte dining. À la carte prices apply." resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.agoda.mobile.consumer" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="67" text="Property announcements" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.agoda.mobile.consumer" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="68" text="See all" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.agoda.mobile.consumer" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="69" text="Nyepi Religious Day: Please be informed that Bali island celebrates Nyepi (Silent) day each year. The Nyepi (Silent) Day is a day of absolute silence throughout the island. No outdoor activities are allowed including check-in and check-out from hotels. 29 March 2025 | 19 March 2026 | 8 March 2027 | 26 March 2028 | 15 March 2029&#10;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special benefit for Suites&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusions: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#10;o   Complimentary activities for young guests at Kura Kura Kids Club &amp; a Gelato voucher upon arrival&lt;br&gt;&#10;o   Signature Conrad Bali mascot Komang placed in room&lt;br&gt;&#10;o   Access to JIWA Wellness facilities&lt;br&gt;&#10;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;* Cold and hot baths&lt;br&gt;&#10;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;* Steam and sauna&lt;br&gt;&#10;o   30-minute on-property photo session (Includes 1x printed photo)&#10;&#10;Children 6-11 years are charged IDR 150k++ for lunch or dinner as part of the Stay and Dine package; 12 yrs and older are considered adults and will be charged adult rates. The credit card used for online room reservations must be presented in person during check-in." resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.agoda.mobile.consumer" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="70" text="Have a question for Conrad Bali?" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.agoda.mobile.consumer" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="71" text="Contact property" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.agoda.mobile.consumer" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="72" text="Quick Answers" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.agoda.mobile.consumer" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[912,1458][1044,1590]" /><node index="73" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.agoda.mobile.consumer" content-desc="" checkable="false"